description:
When you gain mana from Drain Mana or Life Tap spells, your tamed pet gains $s1% of the mana you gain.

Your tamed pet regenerates $s2% of its missing mana every 5 sec.

@ext:Tamed Pet includes Summoned Demon, Enslave Demon, Dominate Undead, Tame Dragonkin, Tether Elemental, Summoned Ghoul, and Tame Beast.:ext@

Increases the damage of all party and raid members by $s3%.

@ext:Does not stack with other similar effects.:ext@

